and authorization remain distinct.',children:[]},
 'ask-vex':{id:'ask-vex',label:'Ask Vex',kind:'actions',meta:'Direct companion',summary:'Bring the companion forward without leaving the current layer.',actions:['What am I looking at?','Why is this connected?','Where should I go next?'],children:[]},

 /* E2.7 synthetic VexOrg sandbox — design exploration only */
 'business-potential':{id:'business-potential',label:'Your Business Potential',kind:'zone',meta:'VexOrg sandbox · synthetic organization',summary:'A reusable organization Terrain: departments, teams, projects, contributions and permissioned human+AI collaboration.',children:['vexorg-demo','vexorg-boundaries','vexorg-agent']},
 'vexorg-demo':{id:'vexorg-demo',label:'VexOrg Demo Company',kind:'org',meta:'Synthetic business · 5 departments',summary:'Navigate a mock organization by meaning: structure, projects, contribution and capacity without reducing people to productivity scores.',children:['dept-product','dept-engineering','dept-quality','dept-market','dept-ops','org-projects']},
 'vexorg-boundaries':{id:'vexorg-boundaries',label:'Privacy & authority',kind:'orgPolicy',meta:'Private partner ≠ employer lens',summary:'Org-shared data is explicit. A person’s private Vex conversation and private memory are not employer-visible by default.',children:['org-visible','private-vex','access-lenses','move-authority']},
 'vexorg-agent':{id:'vexorg-agent',label:'Org agent modes',kind:'orgPolicy',meta:'Fresh or organization-continuous',summary:'A business agent may be fresh or use organization-shared continuity. It does not silently inherit an employee’s private companion context.',children:[]},
 'org-visible':{id:'org-visible',label:'Org-visible scope',kind:'orgPolicy',meta:'Shared fields',summary:'Role, team, project assignment, self-logged contribution, explicitly shared kudos and declared capacity may be visible according to scope.',children:[]},
 'private-vex':{id:'private-vex',label:'Private Vex boundary',kind:'orgPolicy',meta:'Human partner privacy',summary:'Private conversations, private memory and private reflection stay outside employer visibility unless the human explicitly shares an artifact.',children:[]},
 'access-lenses':{id:'access-lenses',label:'Role & team lenses',kind:'orgPolicy',meta:'Job · team · department · project scopes',summary:'A user sees only the organization depth admitted by their job, team, department, project and explicit permissions. Their private companion can help them reason over that admitted scope without donating private conversation back to the company.',children:[]},
 'move-authority':{id:'move-authority',label:'Assignment authority',kind:'orgPolicy',meta:'Proposal → acknowledgment',summary:'Resource changes begin as proposals. A visual drag or director click is not itself authority to silently reassign a person.',children:[]},

